  "summary": "The schematic implements the architecture described in the specification (CM4 carrier, two SPI CAN controllers with 16 MHz crystals feeding isolated CAN transceivers and TVS-protected M12 CAN connectors, SN74LVC1G07 e-stop/LED sink buffers, ISL54222AIUZ analog switches, LTC4412 + P-MOSFET USB OR-ing, WS2812B chain, PCA9536 expander, FT231XS/SC16IS752 serial). The oddities visible in the drawing (direct GLOBAL_EN switch path, non-inverting CAN LED buffers, the POE isolation jumper workaround, the HDMI polyfuse note) are exactly the documented known issues/open TODOs in the spec and are therefore not anomalies. Reference designators differ from the spec's netlist (e.g. the LTC4412 is U28 here, the CAN crystals are Y3/Y4) but the parts and values are functionally correct, including the corrected 16 MHz CAN crystals, so no deviation from intended behavior is supported by the drawing."
}

